  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stabilising Conflict-Affected Communities in Eastern Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project has been designed to deliver urgent stabilization support to communities that have been affected by the Sudan crisis and influxes of returnees from Sudan, with a view to establishing the preconditions needed to promote longer-term development of these areas. At the same time, the project will increase access to essential services, addressing immediate needs and improving the living conditions of vulnerable returnees, whilst also helping to mitigate the risk of intercommunal tension.</narrative>
  </description>
